text:
What?? The first one literally wasn't even a save, he just rushed out of his box to stop the long ball, no other player was even close to it. The second one was just a case of running back to his box in time, and as you can see it clearly didn't take a Usain Bolt effort... 

&#x200B;

I think the amazing volley is blinding people into thinking this was an amazing save (even a double save, for some people). Crazy.
